OpenSWBF2 Link

This plugin contains code and icons adapted from UnrealLink
(https://github.com/JetBrains/UnrealLink), commit a4c20e00f70180e411294c489b91aff75d180a22,
Copyright 2000-2024 JetBrains s.r.o., licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The licence text is in LICENSE-UnrealLink.txt.

All files listed below were modified from the UnrealLink originals: they were renamed, moved to the
org.openswbf2.riderlink package, and changed to read the OpenSWBF2 game's line protocol instead of
UnrealLink's rd model and to drop features that have no counterpart in OpenSWBF2.

